{
  "id": "the-simpsons---7x25---summer-of-42",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 7x25 - Summer Of 4'2",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 7x25 - Summer Of 4'2 .en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T21:03:07.965Z",
  "lineCount": 298,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "The Simpsons",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3903,
      "endMs": 7270
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 10510,
      "endMs": 12478
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Hey, Bart! Summer's almost here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 29062,
      "endMs": 31530
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Which kind of sprinkler do you like?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 31631,
      "endMs": 33599
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "The one that goes like this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 33700,
      "endMs": 38569
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Or the one that goes like this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 38671,
      "endMs": 43574
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Oh, and there's this one!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 43676,
      "endMs": 47737
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "It's the last day of school, Milhouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 47847,
      "endMs": 50475
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Try to show some dignity.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 50583,
      "endMs": 53074
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Gentlemen, start your chimes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 57557,
      "endMs": 61550
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "School's out! Up yours, Krabappel!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 66633,
      "endMs": 69932
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Well, I'm glad the rest of you remembered... that summer vacation starts at the end of the day... not the beginning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 73706,
      "endMs": 80011
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Here you go, ma'am. Hmm. Quick work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 80113,
      "endMs": 83412
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "How'd you know he was gonna run?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 83516,
      "endMs": 85416
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "We've got someone on the inside.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 85518,
      "endMs": 87543
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "The reward for a year's worth of toil and sacrifice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 94227,
      "endMs": 99187
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Retrospecticus. Oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 99299,
      "endMs": 103201
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "The leatheroleum covers were worth the extra money!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 107240,
      "endMs": 110209
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Oh! You can smell the benzene!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110310,
      "endMs": 113336
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Oh, when the kids see these layouts and fonts... you're going to be the most popular girl in school!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113446,
      "endMs": 119209
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "You know something, Beezee? I think you're right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 119319,
      "endMs": 122982
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "\"And so, as Abraham Lincoln sat in Ford's Theatre that night...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123089,
      "endMs": 127150
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "John Wilkes Booth entered, drew his gun and\"- Well, that's it. Have a nice summer, everyone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 127260,
      "endMs": 134224
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "But what happened in Ford's Theatre?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 134334,
      "endMs": 136962
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Was President Lincoln okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 137070,
      "endMs": 139038
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "He was fine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 139139,
      "endMs": 141107
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Go home, Ralph.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 143409,
      "endMs": 145377
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "In the beginning of the school year, each of you received a colored ticket.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 145478,
      "endMs": 149437
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "I hope everyone still has theirs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 149549,
      "endMs": 152848
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Who died and made you boss?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 152952,
      "endMs": 155147
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Mr. Estes, the publications adviser. I edited the whole thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 155255,
      "endMs": 159692
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "If you hadn't done it, some other loser would have, so quit milking it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159792,
      "endMs": 164252
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Hey! Will you guys sign my yearbook?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 172438,
      "endMs": 174998
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 190056,
      "endMs": 192024
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "This is Becky. She's in the second grade.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 194027,
      "endMs": 196587
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Hi, Becky. Thanks for coming out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196696,
      "endMs": 199164
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "\"See ya. \" He writes the way people talk!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 201034,
      "endMs": 205164
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Your daughter is named Seymour?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 206773,
      "endMs": 208764
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Well, I-Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 208875,
      "endMs": 211901
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "I lied. It's for me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 212011,
      "endMs": 214605
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "I don't get it. Straight A's, perfect attendance, bathroom timer- I should be the most popular girl in school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 216382,
      "endMs": 224047
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Homer, I'm in a rhubarb of a pickle of a jam here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 226159,
      "endMs": 229287
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "I was all set to go off on vacation when I get called up for jury duty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229395,
      "endMs": 232922
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Oh, it's a corker of a case.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 233032,
      "endMs": 234932
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Seems a man drove up onto a traffic island... and hit a decorative rowboat full of geraniums.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 235034,
      "endMs": 240639
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Now they're trying it as a maritime offense.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 240740,
      "endMs": 243538
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "So, anyhoo, how'd you like to use my beach house, free of charge?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 243643,
      "endMs": 247511
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "I only get two weeks of vacation a year... and you want me to spend it in your lousy beach house?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 247614,
      "endMs": 253380
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Well, if it'll seal the deal...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 253486,
      "endMs": 256319
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "I'll take a look at your septic tank, see if I can get her humming again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 256422,
      "endMs": 260119
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Deal! See, Flanders? You give a little, you get a little.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260226,
      "endMs": 262990
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Hello, Mr. Brown Ground. What you got for me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 265531,
      "endMs": 268159
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "And you're sure the Flanderses won't be there?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 268268,
      "endMs": 271726
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Well, it sounds great.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 271838,
      "endMs": 273772
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Bart, you can invite Milhouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273873,
      "endMs": 275898
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Lisa, you can bring a friend too. Hey, great!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276009,
      "endMs": 279274
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "A friend- or a companion... or- I don't know- a stuffed animal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279379,
      "endMs": 286046
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Well, did you call one of your friends?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 287487,
      "endMs": 290012
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Friends? Huh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 290123,
      "endMs": 292023
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "These are my only friends- grown-up nerds like Gore Vidal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 292125,
      "endMs": 295891
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "And even he's kissed more boys than I ever will.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 295995,
      "endMs": 298691
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Girls, Lisa. Boys kiss girls.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298798,
      "endMs": 301892
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Mom, why don't I have any friends? We have each other.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 302001,
      "endMs": 305664
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "When I was a lonely little girl...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305772,
      "endMs": 307740
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "I always dreamed that someday my daughter would be my best friend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 307840,
      "endMs": 312573
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "We are best friends, Mom, but I'm a kid.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 312679,
      "endMs": 315580
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "I need friends my own age too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 315682,
      "endMs": 317741
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Honey, you'll make plenty of friends.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 317850,
      "endMs": 319818
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "All you have to do is be yourself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 319919,
      "endMs": 322387
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Be myself? I've been myself for eight years, and it hasn't worked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 324290,
      "endMs": 328090
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Look at all these dorky clothes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 328194,
      "endMs": 330424
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "A bathing cap, nose plugs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 330530,
      "endMs": 334125
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "A microscope at the beach? Aah! What was I thinking?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334233,
      "endMs": 338567
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Mom, I'm gonna tighten Milhouse's straps. He's fidgeting again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 343109,
      "endMs": 346272
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 346379,
      "endMs": 349109
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Lisa, let's go!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 349215,
      "endMs": 350739
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Here- Hmm. Somebody's traveling light.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 352618,
      "endMs": 356054
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Nah. Maybe you're getting stronger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 356155,
      "endMs": 358146
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Well, I have been eating more.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 358257,
      "endMs": 360919
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Wave bye-bye to our house, Maggie. Bye-bye, tree.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 364997,
      "endMs": 368728
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Bye-bye, job. Bye-bye, toothbrush.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 368835,
      "endMs": 371736
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Bye-bye, Lisa Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 371838,
      "endMs": 373806
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "When the hell are we gonna get to- Where the hell are we going?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 380913,
      "endMs": 384713
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "It's called Little Pwagmattasquarmsettport.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 384817,
      "endMs": 388844
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "It's known as America's scrod basket.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 388955,
      "endMs": 391685
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "I thought Springfield was America's scrod basket.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 391791,
      "endMs": 394191
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "No. Springfield is America's crud bucket...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 394293,
      "endMs": 395720
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "at least according to Newsweek.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 401601,
      "endMs": 403228
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "\"Wel-diddly-elcome, Simpsons. \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 410810,
      "endMs": 412801
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Oh, geez! He actually wrote \"diddly. \" That was thoughtful.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 412912,
      "endMs": 416814
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "\"I left a few helpful notes around the house. \" Ah, come- Gee.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 416916,
      "endMs": 422616
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "\"Put food in me. \" I'll take that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 425057,
      "endMs": 427617
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Well, duh! With what, Ned?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 431964,
      "endMs": 434228
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Nice try, Todd.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 442608,
      "endMs": 445839
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Isn't this fun, honey?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 445945,
      "endMs": 447845
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "It must be exciting to make a different set of beds.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 447947,
      "endMs": 450575
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "I know you're joking, but it is!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 450683,
      "endMs": 453447
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Say, why don't you put on your swimsuit and head for the beach?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 453553,
      "endMs": 456522
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Well, it's kind of funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 456622,
      "endMs": 458522
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "With all the craziness and confusion and meshuggaas of packing, I forgot to pack!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 458624,
      "endMs": 463584
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Lisa, that's not at all like you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 463696,
      "endMs": 465857
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Exactly. Hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 465965,
      "endMs": 467933
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "I forgot my swimsuit, too, but I improvised.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468034,
      "endMs": 472528
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Hello.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 472638,
      "endMs": 474538
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Uh, Mom, I'm kind of trying to go for a different look this year.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 480680,
      "endMs": 484377
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Oh, okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 484484,
      "endMs": 486645
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Ooh! How about this adorable sunsuit?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 486752,
      "endMs": 490620
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "It has a starfish on the fanny, and it comes with its own pail.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 490723,
      "endMs": 494887
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Mom, come here.! Bring money.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 494994,
      "endMs": 497861
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "So, where do you want to show off your new, hip togs?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503035,
      "endMs": 506004
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "The Sherbet Shop, the Candle District?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 506105,
      "endMs": 508300
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Big Sue's Tap-Water Taffy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 508407,
      "endMs": 510841
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "If it's okay with you, Mom, I'd rather go find some kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 510943,
      "endMs": 515175
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Oh. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 515281,
      "endMs": 518250
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "You'll be my friend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 519552,
      "endMs": 521520
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "I'm never, never gonna let you get away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 521621,
      "endMs": 525489
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Hey, hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 526893,
      "endMs": 529054
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Last one in is a yearbook editor!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 529161,
      "endMs": 531493
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Full speed ahead! Prepare to dive! Dive!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 531597,
      "endMs": 534896
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "It's low tide, boys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538671,
      "endMs": 541299
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "I wonder where all the kids are.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546279,
      "endMs": 548747
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Hey! A library!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 548848,
      "endMs": 551408
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "No, I can't. That's the old, nerdy Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 551517,
      "endMs": 554918
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Lisa, read about my adventures in the South Seas... and make me live again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 556422,
      "endMs": 562189
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "We've got periodicals on microfiche.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 562295,
      "endMs": 566288
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Won't you join our tea party? It would be ever so- Don't do it, Lisa! It's a trick! Run!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 567700,
      "endMs": 574729
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Run.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 574840,
      "endMs": 576740
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Oh. I don't see any kids at all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 578844,
      "endMs": 581574
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "It's like they ditched me in advance.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 581681,
      "endMs": 584411
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "So he goes, like- I can totally hear him going that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 584517,
      "endMs": 589721
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Only kids are that incoherent!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 589822,
      "endMs": 592620
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "So, my mom tried to take me to some candle place, but I'm all, like, \"No way. \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 598264,
      "endMs": 602394
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Like, you know, whatever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 605571,
      "endMs": 607539
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Like, you know, whatever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 607640,
      "endMs": 609608
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Hey! What's hap- Okay, okay, okay. Not your fault. It's a bird thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 609709,
      "endMs": 615842
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "You don't control the birds.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 615948,
      "endMs": 617916
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "You will someday, but not now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 618017,
      "endMs": 620508
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Hi. 'Sup?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 620620,
      "endMs": 622281
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Who's that? I don't know. Some kid.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 622388,
      "endMs": 624356
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Hey! I like your hat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 624457,
      "endMs": 626357
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "A compliment!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 626459,
      "endMs": 628188
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Scanning for sarcasm. It's clean. Go!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 628294,
      "endMs": 633197
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Thanks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 633299,
      "endMs": 635426
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Um, you guys skate?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 635534,
      "endMs": 638094
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Try to. The cops always confiscate our boards.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 638204,
      "endMs": 641696
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Yeah. And you just know they're using them, like, five minutes later down at the station.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 641807,
      "endMs": 646107
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Hmm. I think I know a place you can skate that's virtually deserted.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646212,
      "endMs": 649807
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Like, you know, whatever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 651751,
      "endMs": 654447
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "All right! Excellent!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654553,
      "endMs": 656953
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 657056,
      "endMs": 658489
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Hey, this place rocks! What'd you say your name was?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 661961,
      "endMs": 664486
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Didn't. It's Lisa. I'm Erin.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 664597,
      "endMs": 667259
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "So, how'd you know about this place? You into books?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 667366,
      "endMs": 670130
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Me? Unlikely.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 670236,
      "endMs": 672136
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "My gooney brother's always going to libraries. I usually hang out in front.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 672238,
      "endMs": 677073
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Oh. You like hanging out too? Well, it beats doin' stuff.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 677176,
      "endMs": 680907
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Yeah. Stuff sucks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 681013,
      "endMs": 682981
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Hey, you up? You can use my board.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 683082,
      "endMs": 685550
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "No! Okay. Thanks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 685651,
      "endMs": 688586
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "That's very, um, rad of you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 688688,
      "endMs": 692283
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 694193,
      "endMs": 696388
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Hey, Bart! Lisa's skateboarding with some cool kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 698931,
      "endMs": 702492
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "And she looks like Blossom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 702601,
      "endMs": 705161
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Lisa? With people?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 705271,
      "endMs": 708297
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "If they're impressed by her, I'm gonna Bart their world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 708407,
      "endMs": 711342
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Okay, Milhouse, you know the drill.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 711444,
      "endMs": 713412
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Right. You go over and wow them. I hide in the shrubs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 713512,
      "endMs": 717846
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Hot stuff comin'through.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 719919,
      "endMs": 722012
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "My friendship- You know you want it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 725958,
      "endMs": 728927
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "That kid, like, tries too hard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 729028,
      "endMs": 731622
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Sh'yeah! The whole thing smacks of effort, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 731731,
      "endMs": 735565
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "That's my dorky little brother, Bart- holomew.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 735668,
      "endMs": 740503
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Who does he think he is with that slingshot in his back pocket? Dennis the Menace?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 740606,
      "endMs": 744770
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Mr. Wilson or something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 744877,
      "endMs": 748176
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "How'd it go? Are we down with them?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 748280,
      "endMs": 750805
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "No! They must've seen you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 750916,
      "endMs": 753908
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Oh, why do we have to play this lousy old game?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 756288,
      "endMs": 759018
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Because it was the only one in the house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 759125,
      "endMs": 761423
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Come on, Homer. Open the door for your mystery date.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761527,
      "endMs": 764223
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Ooh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764330,
      "endMs": 766195
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Captain of the football team. He's a dreamboat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 766298,
      "endMs": 769893
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Don't wait up, Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 770002,
      "endMs": 772436
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Okay, Bart. Your turn, your turn.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772538,
      "endMs": 775166
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "You got the dud!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 780045,
      "endMs": 782809
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Hey, he looks just like you, Poindexter!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 782915,
      "endMs": 787011
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "How come Lisa doesn't have to play? Why does she get to hang out with her friends?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 787119,
      "endMs": 791317
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "You got friends. You got the dud right here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 791423,
      "endMs": 793516
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Stand up for yourself, Poindexter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 793626,
      "endMs": 795560
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Wow, Lisa.! I never appreciated all this, like, sea junk before.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 802234,
      "endMs": 807137
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Hey, that clam's got legs! That's a hermit crab.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 807239,
      "endMs": 810265
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "When she outgrows her old shell, she finds a new one that's a better fit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 810376,
      "endMs": 813812
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Don't be afraid, little friend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 813913,
      "endMs": 815881
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "You'll be the most popular crab on the beach.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 815981,
      "endMs": 818142
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Aw, a gift from my favorite crustacean.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818250,
      "endMs": 822744
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Um, did you learn that word from a teacher or something?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 822855,
      "endMs": 826154
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "No. No, I heard it on Baywatch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826258,
      "endMs": 830126
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Oh, cool. That's cool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 830229,
      "endMs": 832129
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Baywatch. David Hasselhoff, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 832231,
      "endMs": 834199
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Ah. I bet this place sells illegal fireworks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 836802,
      "endMs": 840397
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Just go in and act casual like you buy 'em all the time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840506,
      "endMs": 844875
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Hi. Um- Let me have one of those porno magazines, large box of condoms... a bottle of Old Harper, a couple of those panty shields... and some illegal fireworks... and one of those disposable enemas- no, make it two.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 847046,
      "endMs": 863184
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "My apologies, sir, but the sale of fireworks... is prohibited in this state and is punishable by- Follow me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 863295,
      "endMs": 871161
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Any red-blooded, flag-feeding American would love... the M-320.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875608,
      "endMs": 881476
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Celebrate the independence of your nation by blowing up a small part of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 881580,
      "endMs": 885812
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 885918,
      "endMs": 887283
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Pretty cool of your mom to let us hang out here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 887386,
      "endMs": 889650
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Totally. Not like my mom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 889755,
      "endMs": 891655
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "She'd be butting in with Rice Krispies squares and Tang.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 891757,
      "endMs": 895420
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "My dad's all stoked 'cause today's the Fourth ofJuly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 895527,
      "endMs": 898496
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "He woke me up at dawn to take a loyalty oath. Ugh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 898597,
      "endMs": 902226
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "My mom's French, so we only celebrate Bastille Day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 902334,
      "endMs": 906361
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Well, we could do something fun. Um, how 'bout a beach party?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 906472,
      "endMs": 910306
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Oh, great idea, Lise. Hey, I know where there's a beach!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 910409,
      "endMs": 913173
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "I know where we could get some baguettes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 913279,
      "endMs": 915338
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Gee, I don't know what you've got planned for tonight, Homer... but count me out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 916849,
      "endMs": 921745
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Didn't you buy any meat?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 921854,
      "endMs": 923981
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "This baby's sure to kill something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 924089,
      "endMs": 926387
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Okay now, everybody. Stand back while I celebrate freedom!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 926492,
      "endMs": 930485
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Bart, give me your matches. Fresh out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930596,
      "endMs": 933622
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "No lighter? Nothing?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933732,
      "endMs": 936929
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Oh! Wait. I got it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 937036,
      "endMs": 939527
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944543,
      "endMs": 946443
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "The beer!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 952584,
      "endMs": 955314
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Oh! This is the worst Fourth ofJuly ever. I hate America.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 969001,
      "endMs": 973267
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Come on, Milhouse. Let's go down there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 973372,
      "endMs": 975499
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "I don't think you should. Let Lisa be alone with her new friends.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 975607,
      "endMs": 979600
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "They're my friends rightfully. She only got them by copying me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 979712,
      "endMs": 983273
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Don't have a cow, man!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 983382,
      "endMs": 985316
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "See? That's my expression!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985417,
      "endMs": 987317
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Oh. You haven't said that in four years. Let Lisa have it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 987419,
      "endMs": 991082
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "It's the principle. She's gotta learn.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 991190,
      "endMs": 993590
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "No! Now, park your keister, \"meister. \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 993692,
      "endMs": 996456
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Ay, caramba!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 998897,
      "endMs": 1001695
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Hey, Lise. I made something for you. It's a friendship bracelet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004169,
      "endMs": 1007866
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "For me? Wow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1007973,
      "endMs": 1010533
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "My first real friend... ship bracelet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1010642,
      "endMs": 1014305
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "I don't have anything for you, except this necklace I made.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1014413,
      "endMs": 1018907
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Oh, cool. Thanks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1019018,
      "endMs": 1021987
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Hey, cinnamon dental floss!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1022087,
      "endMs": 1024248
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "I just know we're gonna be friends forever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1024356,
      "endMs": 1027814
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "So, Lisa has a friend. We'll see about that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1032164,
      "endMs": 1036828
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Bart! I need my glasses.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1038070,
      "endMs": 1041870
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Oh. Nice doggy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1041974,
      "endMs": 1044499
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "I'm dizzy! I'm nauseous!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1056388,
      "endMs": 1059551
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Oh, but I'm popular!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1059658,
      "endMs": 1063355
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1065998,
      "endMs": 1067989
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "What's he doing here? My yearbook. No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1068100,
      "endMs": 1072036
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Mm-hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1073138,
      "endMs": 1075402
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Hey, you guys! You want to see how cool Lisa Simpson really is?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1075507,
      "endMs": 1078476
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Check this out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1078577,
      "endMs": 1080738
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Miss Perfect Attendance...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1080846,
      "endMs": 1082746
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Grammar Rodeo head buckaroo, the French table.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1082848,
      "endMs": 1086079
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "Ooh-la-la!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086185,
      "endMs": 1088085
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "\"Teacher's pet\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1091256,
      "endMs": 1093156
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Hey, Lise.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1104503,
      "endMs": 1106403
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "I guess my little yearbook stunt was pretty rough... but it did teach you a lesson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1108507,
      "endMs": 1113801
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "It's important to be yourself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1113912,
      "endMs": 1116574
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "I know exactly who I am.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1117783,
      "endMs": 1119751
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "I am the sister of a rotten, jealous, mean, little sneak!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1119852,
      "endMs": 1124186
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "You cost me my only friends!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1124289,
      "endMs": 1126757
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "You've ruined my life!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126859,
      "endMs": 1129054
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Hey, kids! There's a carnival tonight!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1129161,
      "endMs": 1130687
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Oh, boy! A carnival!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1136468,
      "endMs": 1137901
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1142908,
      "endMs": 1146639
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Kids, stop that! Don't make me get the carny!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1146745,
      "endMs": 1150044
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Hey, Lisa! Make friends with this!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1153385,
      "endMs": 1155853
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1157289,
      "endMs": 1159587
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Help! Help!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1159691,
      "endMs": 1163457
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Remember, kids, there's no need to bump. Just enjoy the ride.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1163562,
      "endMs": 1168397
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1177809,
      "endMs": 1180300
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Lisa, wait!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1192724,
      "endMs": 1194624
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Being myself didn't work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1199565,
      "endMs": 1201760
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "Being someone else didn't work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1201867,
      "endMs": 1204427
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "Maybe I just wasn't meant to have friends.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1204536,
      "endMs": 1207061
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Lisa is gonna freak when she sees this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1207172,
      "endMs": 1209640
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "Well, hurry up. They'll be back soon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209741,
      "endMs": 1212141
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "Lisa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1213845,
      "endMs": 1216211
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "Okay. You found out I'm an overachieving bookworm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1216315,
      "endMs": 1218875
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "So whatever mean prank you're pulling, just finish it up and send me a Polaroid.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1218984,
      "endMs": 1223546
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "I'm going to sleep. Wait, Lisa.! Look.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1223655,
      "endMs": 1226556
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Huh? Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1230195,
      "endMs": 1232993
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "Oh! Oh! Cool, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1233098,
      "endMs": 1235760
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "Well, now you can take the beach with you wherever you go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1235867,
      "endMs": 1238836
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "Uh, but don't drive at night.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1238937,
      "endMs": 1241337
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "Does this mean you still want to be friends... even though I tried to cover up my nerdish leanings?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1241440,
      "endMs": 1247174
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "Look, we don't care who you were... and you can't fake the kind of good person that you are.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1247279,
      "endMs": 1252882
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "Yeah. You taught us about cool things... like nature and why we shouldn't drink seawater.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1252985,
      "endMs": 1258887
    },
    {
      "index": 287,
      "text": "This is the most thoughtful thing anybody ever- Sweet merciful crap.! My car.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1258991,
      "endMs": 1264961
    },
    {
      "index": 288,
      "text": "The polite thing to do would've been to clean the shells first.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1267733,
      "endMs": 1271965
    },
    {
      "index": 289,
      "text": "Shoo! Shoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1272070,
      "endMs": 1273867
    },
    {
      "index": 290,
      "text": "I guess I should give this back to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1273972,
      "endMs": 1276133
    },
    {
      "index": 291,
      "text": "I showed it to your friends again before we left.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1276241,
      "endMs": 1278709
    },
    {
      "index": 292,
      "text": "Bart! Look inside.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1278810,
      "endMs": 1280710
    },
    {
      "index": 293,
      "text": "Oh. Thanks, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1286351,
      "endMs": 1290048
    },
    {
      "index": 294,
      "text": "I signed it too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1290155,
      "endMs": 1293318
    },
    {
      "index": 295,
      "text": "Uh-huh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1294259,
      "endMs": 1296819
    },
    {
      "index": 296,
      "text": "Well, get a last look at the beautiful ocean scenery, kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1299097,
      "endMs": 1302897
    },
    {
      "index": 297,
      "text": "Shh! www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1360459,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 7,
    "episode": 25
  }
}
